ust admit that my dad\\fis the true Trainer!\\r","msg_0497_T07R0104_00004":"Falkner: You were listening, right?\\nYou agree my dad is\\fgreater, right? {YESNO 0}","msg_0497_T07R0104_00005":"Falkner: You do?\\nJust as I thought!\\rYou know something?\\nI’m sure we’ll enjoy talking about\\fmy dad!\\fHere is my number!\\r","msg_0497_T07R0104_00006":"{STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0} registered Falkner\\nin the Pokégear!","msg_0497_T07R0104_00007":"Falkner: Give me a call on Saturday\\nmorning if you want to hear about\\fmy dad!","msg_0497_T07R0104_00008":"Falkner: You don’t?\\nI thought you were smarter than that.\\rOh, well.\\fYou’ll change your mind eventually.","msg_0497_T07R0104_00009":"Falkner: So, you did change your mind.\\nYou now think my dad\\fis greater? {YESNO 0}","msg_0497_T07R0104_00010":"Falkner: Hey, why don’t we take\\na picture together? {YESNO 0}","msg_0497_T07R0104_00011":"Falkner: All right!\\nAre you ready?\\r","msg_0497_T07R0104_00012":"Falkner: Yes!\\nWe look good.","msg_0497_T07R0104_00013":"Falkner: That’s all right.\\nI’ll just take one with my dad...","msg_0497_T07R0104_00014":"Your Photo Album is full.\\rAccess your PC and delete\\nsome pictures.","msg_0497_T07R0104_00015":"Janine: Bah!","msg_0497_T07R0104_00016":"I’m here to buy Bloom Mail to send\\nto my girlfriend.","msg_0497_T07R0104_00017":"You know what?\\rTunnel Mail is finally available\\nat this department store!\\rPreviously, it was only sold\\nin Violet City.","msg_0497_T07R0104_00018":"Gifts to Express Yourself!\\n4F: Wiseman Gifts"},"initTriggers":[],"initScripts":{"OnTransition":"_EV_scr_seq_T07R0104_004 + 1"},"constants":{"_EV_scr_seq_T07R0104_000":0,"_EV_scr_seq_T07R0104_001":1,"_EV_scr_seq_T07R0104_002":2,"_EV_scr_seq_T07R0104_003":3,"_EV_scr_seq_T07R0104_004":4,"_EV_scr_seq_T07R0104_005":5,"_EV_scr_seq_T07R0104_006":6,"obj_T07R0104_shopm1_2":0,"obj_T07R0104_gsboy1":1,"obj_T07R0104_gsman1":2,"obj_T07R0104_gsleader1":3,"obj_T07R0104_gsleader13":4}}
